## Design tokens — source unique

```typescript
// packages/shared-config/theme.ts (partagé mobile + web)
export const colors = {
  bg: '#FFFFFF',
  text: '#0F172A',
  textMuted: '#64748B',
  border: '#E2E8F0',
  primary: '#22c55e',           // vert Clean Connect (mode prestataire)
  primaryHover: '#16a34a',
  neutral: '#0F172A',            // mode client (sobre)
  success: '#22c55e',
  warning: '#f59e0b',
  danger: '#ef4444',
}

export const radius = { sm: 8, md: 12, lg: 16, xl: 20 } as const
export const spacing = { 1: 4, 2: 8, 3: 12, 4: 16, 6: 24, 8: 32, 10: 40 } as const
```

**Règles** :
- **Aucun hex code en dur** dans un composant — toujours via tokens
- Cards : `borderRadius: 16-20`, fond `#FFFFFF`, border subtile, **pas de dégradés**
- Typographie Inter (mobile : police chargée via expo-font ; web : `@fontsource/inter`)

